01:11:11.760 --> 01:11:18.640
The official documentation says that the offset&nbsp;
matrix transforms from mesh space to bone space&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:11:18.640 --> 01:11:25.120
in Bind Pose, which is basically saying that if&nbsp;
you take a vertex in local space, while the model&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:11:25.120 --> 01:11:31.680
